# NOTE: amplify_outputs.json is intentionally COMMITTED so a fresh clone can run
# against the deployed backend (required for the submission build). It contains
# only public config (AppSync endpoint, region, Cognito pool/client IDs) — no
# secrets. Still ignore any other variants (e.g. backups, alt environments).
amplify_outputs.*.json

